      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Rang on 22nd January 2020 to have a quote done on replacing an old solar hot water system on the roof with a Solahart system. I was advised that Craig would be attending the next day (wow) at 8am to give me a quote. Spot on 8am, Craig arrived and had a look at the existing old set up and told me that included in the quote would be taking away the old solar system as well as the electric hot water system that had just died and they could actually do the installation that day! Unfortunately I could not do that but later rang to arrange a suitable installation date. Installation date for the Australian made system was 30th January 2020. The Solahart team arrived on time and were friendly and proffessional. Nothing was a problem, no questions I had on the day went unanswered and after cleaning up, the team was finished in the timeframe given to me. The whole experience was just brilliant from start to finish and I would not hesitate to recommend Sola hart to anyone interested.",
