      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We decided a year ago to have a Solahart hot water system installed, as we had previously had Solahart on two houses prior to this one.  What a mistake.  I have to run the booster switch for four out of seven days, minimum, each week at present (2014 winter) and Solahart Gold Coast have told me that this is the way it was intended to operate.  The system is still under warranty and when installed just prior to last winter, was so hot, even during 2013 winter, we had to run cold to be able to shower safely.  Now, however, we can't use cold water at all to shower, unless we have the booster on constantly, yet Solahart Gold Coast tell us that this is normal.  savings on water heating....I can't see it!  I'll never recommend Solahart again at this rate.",
